        <UserObject label="Master Thread :&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Independent execution loop,&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Auto regulate speed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Can sync to another master thread&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Own his objects&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Has Thread safe interface to communicate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; with other masters&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Has dynamic Task Stack (next, delay, after, before)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Can has Thread Pool for simultaneous execution&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;On Setup :&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Register a sequance of Task : main sequance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Main Sequance will be executed in order each iteration&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; of the execution loop. Each Task start after the completion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; of the last.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tags="BIN" id="hE0v4sO0SDhd-ZCMcQvp-76">
